  <name>Nauta</name>
  <summary>Listen to your Navidrome library</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Nauta plays the music of your own Navidrome server, or another
      OpenSubsonic server, on a Phosh phone and on the desktop.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Browse albums, artists and playlists, and search the library</li>
      <li>Play an album, a playlist or a search result, in order or shuffled</li>
      <li>At home it talks to the server directly, elsewhere through its public address</li>
      <li>Works with servers that require a client certificate</li>
      <li>Separate streaming quality at home and away</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Nauta is an independent project and not affiliated with the
      Navidrome project.
    </p>
  </description>
  <developer id="de.nexumia">
